 34 │ 
 35 │ Ledgerline offers two distinct scopes for its caching mechanisms, configurable per model or globally:
    · ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────
    ·                                                   ╰── machine-favored phrasing peaks at 'model or globally:'
